    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kuzikiriza abamaghanga agandi, abali buti mu nsi imwe y'ali kubagha. Olwo imwe mutwale ebibuga byaibwe n'endhu dhaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kusala mu nsi eyo ebiketezo bisatu, mu buli kiketezo mulondemu ekibuga kirala era mulongoose n'enguudo. Olwo, ole anaabanga ng'aise omuntu, anaasobolanga okulumukira mu kindi ku bibuga ebyo ebisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.2+DEU.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.2",
              "DEU.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole anaabanga ng'aise omuntu, nga tagendereire era ng'omuntu y'aise tabaire muzigu y'ali, aidha kulumukiranga mu kindi ku bibuga ebyo, awonienga obulamu bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eky'okuboneraku kiikino: Omuntu asobola okuja ni mwine mu kibira okutema omuti. Yaaghanika empasa okugutema, aye empasa yaaghanguka mu muyini gwayo, yaakuba mwine yaamwita. Oyo aise, anaasobolanga okulumukira mu kindi ku bibuga ebyo, yaawonia obulamu bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye olugendo lusobola okuba oluleeyi einho okukituukamu. Olwo, owoluganda lw'ole ye baise avunaanizibwa okumwesasuulizaagho, olw'obusungu bw'ali nabwo yaabingirira ole aise, yaamutuukaku yaamwita. Ate nga tiyandigwaniire kufa, kuba y'aise aba nga tabaire muzigu y'ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyenva ndi kubalagira mulondegho ebibuga bisatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kugaziya ekiketezo kyaimwe nga bwe yasuubiza badhaadha baimwe, era abaghe ensi yoonayoona ye yasuubiza okugha badhaadha baimwe abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo aidha kukikola kasita munaakuumanga ebiragiro bino byonabyona bye ndi kubagha olwaleero, ni mugonza Musengwa Katonda waimwe, era ni mujiira ku ebyo by'alagira. Olwo ku bibuga ebyo ebisatu, mulyongeraku ebindi bisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kukolanga mutyo, olwo abantu abaziraku musango balobenga kwitibwa, era mwena mulobenga kuvunaanibwa lwa kwita bantu baziraku musango, mu nsi yaimwe Musengwa Katonda waimwe y'ali kubagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omuntu asobola okukyagha mwine, yaamweteega, yaamuzinduukiriza, yaamukuba, yaamwita, olwo yaalumukira mu kindi ku bibuga ebyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu ng'oti n'oyo, abakulembeze b'omu kibuga kyaimwe banaatumanga abantu baaja baamutoolayo, yaagheebwayo y'owoluganda lw'ole ye baise avunaanizibwa okumwesasuulizaagho, olwo yaitibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamusaasiranga naire, aye mutoolengagho ekibi eky'okwita abantu abaziraku musango mu Isiraeli, memale mughange okubanga abalamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
